<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\パフェ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\パフェ全体.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Thank you for waiting. The spring strawberry parfait."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A gigantic parfait was set down in front of <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh-hooo! Here it is, here it is! Sorry about this, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s expression changed instantly, and she was happily admiring the parfait.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Oh, no, no... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Have as much as you like."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> went for the cookie on the very top first.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Being able to switch how she acts in an instant, whatever the mood around her, is what's amazing about <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\ポリポリ食べる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mmm! Crispy, crunchy! A parfait's cookie must indeed be eaten before it goes </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="しけ">soggy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ignoring the two of us, frozen after hearing about a flayed body, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> plunged her long spoon to the bottom of the parfait in one go.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ha, haha... Glad you're enjoying it..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
But my head was taken up with something else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤人.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A bright-red body, dying beneath a cherry tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's exactly the dream I had earlier...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could there be some connection between that dream and this incident―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> sank her teeth into the bright-red strawberry 
{PLAYSND "SE\ガブリ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
with a big chomp.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Red strawberry juice trickled from <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s mouth.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, I need the restroom..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you okay? Want me to come with you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, I'm feeling good today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I stood up, I forced a smile their way.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "6" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ファミレストイレ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I went into the restroom and let out a long breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A bright-red body, and still conscious even so...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> has an innocent, lively face, but she's very smart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> is a bundle of curiosity and drive, but more thoughtful and kind than anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And me...<PG>
I probably have no personality to speak of, apart from hating cherry blossoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Grades, dead middle; sports, lower middle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I do have a strange trait.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It's intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have abnormally sharp intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To be more specific, I'm eerily good at sensing danger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So good you could practically call it precognition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Many times before, I'd sensed all sorts of dangers and escaped harm.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\草むら.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
For example, last spring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stopped <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> when she was about to step into some tall grass.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マムシ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> had taken one more step then, she'd probably have stepped on the pit viper there and been bitten.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Other times too: <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>'s car accident, and the train accident on <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE>'s business trip.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It happened a few times with me, too.<PG>
If you call it coincidence, it can be written off as coincidence, and calling it a trait of mine is an exaggeration.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> all know about my intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So they take my warnings at face value.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢桜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And the other strange thing: this intuition only works at this time of year, while the cherry blossoms are out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though that doesn't mean I can always sense danger just because the cherry blossoms are out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are times I can sense it, and times I can't.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\夢の目.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And then that dream earlier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow it seemed like it had to be connected to <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s reasoning...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried to remember more of that dream.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢桜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤人.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A bright-red person lay collapsed, asking me for help.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then blood began raining from the cherry tree, and my ankle was grabbed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the end, that person screamed at me, and the dream ended.<PG>
............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, that's wrong. I'm misunderstanding something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something just doesn't fit.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ファミレストイレ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Whew..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took another big, deep breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll try asking <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> about the dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She might be able to analyze it.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
